  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "thimble_meeting_open",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Hello! I am Thimble. This envelope used to hold seeds. Now it holds the idea of seeds, which is much easier to carry.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "not_flag": "met_thimble"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "met_thimble",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "thimble_meeting_question"
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_meeting_question",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "I am deciding what belongs beside what. The garden seems willing to try more things than I expected.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "What was your first garden like?",
          "next": "thimble_meeting_value_1"
        },
        {
          "text": "How would you choose a flower?",
          "next": "thimble_meeting_value_2"
        },
        {
          "text": "Who lives by the moss?",
          "next": "thimble_meeting_value_3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_meeting_value_1",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "I remember a garden full of pointed leaves. I liked it very much. That does not mean every garden needs to be that garden.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        }
      ],
      "next": "thimble_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_meeting_value_2",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "Whatever catches your eye. We can look at its shape first and find a reason afterward, if we need one.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        }
      ],
      "next": "thimble_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_meeting_value_3",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "That is Nuzzle by the moss. A neighbour, not a gardening problem. We have different opinions about damp corners.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        }
      ],
      "next": "thimble_meeting_close"
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_meeting_close",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "meeting",
      "text": "If you plant something you like, I would enjoy seeing it. If you only come to look, I would enjoy that too.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_greeting_dawn_clear",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "The dew is holding tiny copies of the dawn. I counted six on that leaf, then the seventh rolled into view.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "time": "dawn"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_greeting_dawn_rain",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Dawn rain! The leaf tips are making room for each new drop. I am trying to take the hint with my seed envelopes.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "time": "dawn"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_greeting_day_clear",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "That flower has turned toward the light. Entirely without consulting my sketch.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "time": "day"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_greeting_day_rain",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "The garden colours look deeper in rain. My apron mostly looks wetter. Still an interesting result.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "time": "day"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_greeting_dusk_clear",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "At dusk, the pale petals stay visible longest. The darker ones have not gone anywhere. They have simply become harder to count.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "time": "dusk"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_greeting_dusk_rain",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Evening rain has filled the curled leaf again. Nuzzle inspected it earlier. Very thorough work.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "time": "dusk"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_greeting_night_clear",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "The garden is quieter tonight. I was about to rearrange the envelopes, but I think I shall just look.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "time": "night"
        },
        {
          "weather": "clear"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_greeting_night_rain",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "greeting",
      "text": "Rain on leaves sounds different from rain on felt. We have an excellent place here to compare them.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "time": "night"
        },
        {
          "weather": "rain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_quest_offer",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Would you choose a garden place to show me? Plant any unlocked variety you like, or show me something already growing there.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_thimble_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_thimble_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "choices": [
        {
          "text": "I will choose a place to show you.",
          "next": "thimble_quest_accept"
        },
        {
          "text": "I would like to look around first.",
          "next": "thimble_quest_defer"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_quest_accept",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Wonderful. We can begin by looking at the garden together. I will try not to suggest the first leaf that comes to mind.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_thimble_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_thimble_accepted"
        }
      ],
      "effects": [
        {
          "set_flag": "q_thimble_accepted",
          "value": true
        }
      ],
      "next": "thimble_quest_travel_wait"
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_quest_defer",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Certainly. I can look without deciding for a while. It may be very good practice.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_thimble_done"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_thimble_accepted"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_quest_travel_wait",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "quest",
      "text": "Meet me at the garden when you feel like looking. There is no need to plant anything before we talk.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_thimble_done"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_thimble_accepted"
