    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_relationship_acquaintance",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "I could ask you a great many questions about flowers. I will begin with one, whenever you have an answer you would like to share.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "not_flag": "q_thimble_done"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "thimble_relationship_friend",
      "speaker": "thimble",
      "kind": "relationship",
      "text": "You showed me a choice instead of asking for the correct one. I feel as though I can bring you a different idea without apologising for it.",
      "conditions": [
        {
          "flag": "met_thimble"
        },
        {
          "flag": "q_thimble_done"
